  "query_preview": "..\nKey Message 1: Quieter weather through Friday. Increasing rain\nchances for the weekend.\n\n\nMuch of the rest of this week should be dry and dominated with \nan upper ridge of high pressure. Temperatures should remain on\nthe cooler side for the end of July, along with lower humidity. \nA slow-moving low pressure system approaches from the west by\nSaturday, increasing rain chances for the weekend and into early\nnext week. Temperatures still expected to remain on the cooler\nside as a result of clouds and rain, but humidity will return \nwith the increasing southerly flow.",
